# Dockerfile web-builder stage) from web-admin sources, then embedded into the
# Go binary via the go:embed directive in assets.go. Committing it made every
# UI change look like dozens of unrelated binary diffs, so the artifact is no
# longer tracked. Run: make web-build
/web/dist/

